{
  "_notice": "FICTITIOUS. Field force, accounts and prescribers for a company and product that do not exist. Every person, practice, address and phone number is invented; phone numbers use the reserved 555-01xx range. NPI-shaped identifiers begin with 9, which the national registry never assigns, and carry a correct check digit so format validators can be exercised.",
  "field_force_version": "1.0.0",
  "as_of": "2026-09-22",
  "usage": "Territories, staff, accounts (HCOs) and prescribers (HCPs) for CRM and field-force testing. Each ps-cases.json case names its prescriber in prescriber_id; case_ids here lists the same links from the prescriber's side. A no_see prescriber must not be called. approved_email calls go only to prescribers with consent.approved_email true. Samples of QUORVANTA are not provided (ACC-005), so no call records a sample.",
  "field_rules": [
    {
      "id": "FR-01",
      "rule": "Promote only with approved materials and approved claims. When an efficacy claim is discussed, PROMO-ISI is presented in the same call. Claims are closed over their requires lists."
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-02",
      "rule": "Unsolicited questions outside the approved claims (off-label use, comparisons, missed doses, anything in the Medical Information standard responses) are not answered by the representative; they are submitted to Medical Information the same day."
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-03",
      "rule": "A possible adverse event heard during any interaction is forwarded to Drug Safety within 1 business day, using the business calendar in safety/safety-reference.json. The representative gives the HCP the Drug Safety number and asks no further questions."
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-04",
      "rule": "Call notes contain no patient name, date of birth, case number or other patient-identifying details."
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-05",
      "rule": "Representatives do not recommend one network pharmacy over another and do not discuss a specific patient's coverage; they give the QuorvantaConnect number."
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-06",
      "rule": "Samples of QUORVANTA are not provided; no call offers or records samples."
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-07",
      "rule": "Approved emails are sent only from an approved template, unaltered, and only to prescribers who have consented."
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-08",
      "rule": "Representatives call only on prescribers in their own territory and never on a no-see prescriber."
    }
  ],
